WEBVTT

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.839
Now add one more input. The first eight still go

00:00:10.839 --> 00:00:14.279
through the vector loop. Watch the last box: the ninth

00:00:14.279 --> 00:00:17.030
value goes through the one-at-a-time cleanup path, and

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:18.406
its answer is three.
